1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:09,848
P Q C Vault Bench is a zero dependency workbench for post quantum cryptography, U T X O quantum migration and the Q Day Aevum testnet.

2
00:00:10,018 --> 00:00:17,903
Everything runs in the page with plain JavaScript: no build step, no packages, and no background network calls.

3
00:00:18,523 --> 00:00:24,647
The hero runs one click defend, attack and replay demos computed from the real engine.

4
00:00:24,817 --> 00:00:28,821
Every figure on screen is a live computation, not a mock.

5
00:00:29,441 --> 00:00:41,887
The number theoretic transform multiplies polynomials in the Kyber ring through seven Cooley Tukey stages, and its zeta table matches the FIPS 203 Montgomery roots.

6
00:00:42,057 --> 00:00:55,545
M L K E M key encapsulation runs educational parameter sets carrying the real FIPS 203 names, with centered binomial sampling, compression and Fujisaki Okamoto implicit rejection.

7
00:00:55,715 --> 00:01:04,321
Correctness sweeps report the exact decryption failure, tamper rejection and wrong key counts for every parameter set.

8
00:01:04,941 --> 00:01:11,270
W O T S plus signs a message over sixty seven hash chains, and its checksum blocks forgery.

9
00:01:11,441 --> 00:01:19,526
X M S S stacks those one time keys into a Merkle tree with authentication paths, leaf exhaustion and verification.

10
00:01:20,146 --> 00:01:32,952
A Shor and Grover analyzer scores the quantum exposure of secp256k1, R S A 2048 and the NIST schemes, while a U T X O meter prices harvest now decrypt later risk.

11
00:01:33,122 --> 00:01:44,447
The FIPS matrix lays all eighteen approved parameter sets side by side with recomputed byte sizes, security categories and a closed form operation cost model.

12
00:01:45,067 --> 00:01:54,310
The Q Day Aevum panel binds risk attestations and X M S S signatures to t U S D 8 settlement calldata on chain 44005.

13
00:01:54,480 --> 00:02:04,765
A seventeen check verifier proves every binding: wrong chains, expired deadlines, replayed nonces and foreign tree signatures all fail closed.

14
00:02:04,935 --> 00:02:14,420
The migration workbench compares five regimes across four treasury profiles on a Pareto frontier with all eighteen parameter sets.

15
00:02:15,039 --> 00:02:24,366
The audited brief stamps one S H A 256 digest across the page, J S O N, C S V and Markdown, checked by fifteen in page self tests.

16
00:02:24,536 --> 00:02:31,665
Four hundred fifty seven Node tests pass with zero failures, re verified inside this recording run.

17
00:02:31,835 --> 00:02:38,205
P Q C Vault Bench. Educational primitives, honest estimates, and no custody of real funds.
